From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KintTany port maintainer <patches@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:55:00 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] BladesTime: keep Vulkan shader capture running through intro

BladesTime's Gaijin/intro videos continue longer than the default
20-second no-new-shaders cutoff on macOS' headless capture host.
Run 44843909597 captured its eight first SPIR-V shaders, then
SIGTERM stopped the game during gaijin.ogm, BEFORE its failing Nintendo
ec initialization could be exercised.

Allow 90 seconds without a new shader for this one Vulkan title.
Retain the existing maximum CAPTURE_SECS=120; other titles remain at 20
seconds. This collects any post-intro shaders and makes the actual
offline eShop startup visible in the Mac diagnostic log, instead of
claiming the corrected startup was verified from a premature capture.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: verify BladesTime post-intro offline ec initialization and collect genuine menu SPIR-V
Issue: joao9vegeto-stack/KintTany BladesTime run 44843909597
---
 scripts/build_ipa_from_nsp.py | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/scripts/build_ipa_from_nsp.py b/scripts/build_ipa_from_nsp.py
--- a/scripts/build_ipa_from_nsp.py
+++ b/scripts/build_ipa_from_nsp.py
@@ -2005,7 +2005,8 @@
     def done():   # every listed key is there; without the table, none has been added for 20 s
         got = capture_done(cap, api); n = len(got & want if want else got); PROG.set(done=n)
         if n != last['n']: last['n'], last['t'] = n, time.time()
-        return bool((want and got >= want) or (not want and n and time.time() - last['t'] > 20))
+        idle_s = 90 if api == 'vk' and g.id.upper() == '0100CFA00CC74000' else 20
+        return bool((want and got >= want) or (not want and n and time.time() - last['t'] > idle_s))
     rc = boot_mac(host, patched, henv, rd, log, CAPTURE_SECS, done)
     got = capture_done(cap, api)
     if rc is not None and not (want and got >= want): host_stopped(log, rc, time.time() - t0)

-- 
